#ASSERT `s 67(4) the service is a qualifying service for the purposes of subsection (2)` `s 67(4)(c) personal care` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 67(4) the service is a qualifying service for the purposes of subsection (2)` `s 67(4) another service` EQUALS NOTHING

